    "result": "## Summary\n\n\u2705 **Bug fixed!** The issue was in how the `frai` CLI's `gate` command was passing arguments to `frai-gate`.\n\n**Root cause:** The action handler was only receiving positional arguments, causing the `--ci` flag to be lost during delegation.\n\n**Solution:** Modified the handler to extract all arguments directly from `process.argv` after the `gate` command, preserving flags like `--ci`.\n\n**Changes made:**\n- `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts` (lines 753-754): Changed from using just the `args` parameter to using `process.argv.slice(gateIndex + 1)` to capture all arguments including flags.\n\n**Verification:** Rebuilt with `pnpm --filter frai build` and tested \u2014 `frai gate init --ci` now correctly creates both:\n- \u2705 `FRAI-SPEC.md`\n- \u2705 `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`",
